  "body": "Enjoy the very best of coastal living at 34 Clansman Terrace, a distinctive cedar home combining stunning views towards Okoromai Bay and Rangitoto Island, generous indoor-outdoor living and exceptional versatility in one of Gulf Harbour's appealing residential settings.\r\n\r\nElevated to capture the beautiful coastal outlook, the home enjoys a sunny northerly aspect, with views providing an ever-changing backdrop to everyday life. Established landscaping adds to the property's character, while three separate decks offer a wonderful choice of outdoor spaces for relaxing, entertaining and enjoying the surroundings.\r\n\r\n* Spacious, Light-Filled Living\r\nInside, high ceilings, abundant natural light and soft neutral interiors create a wonderful sense of space. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas flow effortlessly together, offering a welcoming environment for both family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen enjoys three separate outlooks, while a striking two-way gas fireplace provides warmth and ambience to both the lounge and dining areas.\r\n\r\nFlexible living is a defining feature of this home. Offering the choice of three bedrooms and two lounges, or four bedrooms and one lounge, the layout adapts easily to changing needs. The versatile upstairs room, previously used as a bedroom and currently presented as a second lounge, could equally serve as a home office, music room or additional family accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe primary bedroom suite is conveniently located on the main level, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Downstairs, two further bedrooms and a family bathroom offer excellent separation and privacy, ideal for families, teenagers or visiting guests.\r\n\r\n* A Standalone Garage with Exciting Possibilities\r\nA particularly valuable feature is the substantial 36metres square standalone double garage, offering far more than conventional vehicle storage.\r\n\r\nCurrently also utilised as a home office, this separate building presents outstanding flexibility for professionals working from home, small business owners, hobbyists or anyone seeking a dedicated workshop or creative studio.\r\n\r\nFor buyers with longer-term plans, there is also potential to explore conversion to additional accommodation, subject to the necessary council approvals.\r\n\r\nThe sweeping driveway provides extensive off-street parking, with generous space for additional vehicles, a boat, caravan or motorhome - an increasingly desirable feature for those embracing the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\n* Outdoor Living at Its Best\r\nWith three separate decks, this home offers a wonderful choice of outdoor spaces for relaxing, entertaining and enjoying the coastal surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe expansive, north-facing rear deck provides a private, sun-filled setting for alfresco dining, summer barbecues and entertaining family and friends, with seamless access from the main living areas.\r\n\r\nFor those who appreciate a beautiful outlook, a deck adjoining the kitchen offers stunning views across Okoromai Bay and towards Rangitoto Island, while a separate front deck provides another inviting vantage point from which to enjoy views of Rangitoto.\r\n\r\nWhether entertaining a crowd, enjoying a morning coffee overlooking the bay or simply relaxing in the sunshine, these three outdoor spaces offer something for every occasion.\r\n\r\n* An Enviable Gulf Harbour Lifestyle\r\nPositioned to enjoy the attractions of the Hibiscus Coast, the home is within easy reach of beautiful beaches, coastal walks, Gulf Harbour Marina and local cafes and restaurants.\r\n\r\nWhether your interests include boating, exploring the coastline or simply enjoying the tranquillity of your surroundings, this location offers a wonderful balance of recreation, relaxation and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nCombining breathtaking coastal views, distinctive cedar character, flexible three- or four-bedroom accommodation and a versatile standalone 36 metre square garage, 34 Clansman Terrace offers an exceptional opportunity to enjoy coastal living without compromising on space or practicality.",
